      "source_extraction": "pdftotext",
      "technical_purpose": "Turret/carousel rotation fault",
      "text": "115 Turret Rotate Fault\nDuring a tool changer operation the tool turret failed to start\nmoving, failed to stop moving or failed to stop at the right\nposition. Parameters 60 and 61 can adjust the delays. This\nalarm can be caused by anything that jams the rotation of the\nturret. A loss of power to the tool changer can also cause this.\nCheck relays K9-K12, and fuse F1 on IOPCB.",
      "revision_group": "vf_alarm_115",
      "is_revision_pair": true
    },
