      "extraction_quality": "good",
      "source_extraction": "pdftotext",
      "technical_purpose": "Gearbox failed to reach high gear",
      "text": "117 Spindle High Gear Fault\nGearbox did not shift into high gear. During a change to high\ngear, the spindle is rotated slowly while air pressure is used to\nchange gears but the high gear sensor was not detected in time.\nParameters 67, 70 and 75 can adjust the delays. Check the air\npressure, circuit breaker CB4,the circuit breaker for the air\npressure solenoids, and the spindle drive.",
      "revision_group": "vf_alarm_117",
      "is_revision_pair": true
    },
