      "source_extraction": "pdftotext",
      "technical_purpose": "Regenerative load/control overheating",
      "text": "122 Regen Overheat\nThe control is overheating. This alarm will turn off the spindle\ndrive, coolant pump, and tool changer. One common cause of\nthis overheat condition is an input line voltage too high. If this\ncondition persists, an automatic shutdown will begin after the\ninterval specified by parameter 297. It can also be caused by a\nhigh start/stop duty cycle of spindle.",
      "revision_group": "vf_alarm_122",
      "is_revision_pair": true
    },
