      "technical_purpose": "X-axis following/position error too large",
      "text": "103 X Servo Error Too Large\nToo much load or speed on X-axis motor. The difference between\nthe motor position and the commanded position has exceeded a\nparameter. The motor may also be stalled, disconnected, or the\ndriver failed. The servos will be turned off and a RESET must be\ndone to restart. This alarm can be caused by problems with the\ndriver, motor, or the slide being run into the mechanical stops.",
      "revision_group": "vf_alarm_103",
      "is_revision_pair": true
    },
    {
